    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but the \"impartial support\" you mentioned feels pretty optimistic given everything else. if we're being honest, isn't it pretty much always a setup where the big players set the rules and everyone else just has to play along? like, can even the 'good' stuff like health or aid really be separate from the geopolitical agenda of whoever is funding it?",
